              "Smaller file, **no** quality lost — original can be restored exactly"
            ],
            [
              "**Lossy compression** (JPEG)",
              "Much smaller file; some detail **permanently removed**"
            ],
            [
              "**Crop** the image",
              "Removes unwanted pixels"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "comparison",
